# Input

```astro
---
const x = 1;
---
<div>{x && <section><!-- single --><p>hi</p></section>}</div>
<div>{<!-- lead --> <a></a>}</div>
<div>{x && <span is:raw>  keep   me  </span>}</div>

```


# Formatted

```astro
---
const x = 1;
---

<div>
	{x && (
		<section>
			<!-- single -->
			<p>hi</p>
		</section>
	)}
</div>
<div>
	{<!-- lead -->
	<a></a>}
</div>
<div>{x && <span is:raw>  keep   me  </span>}</div>

```
